## Network Analyzer

A Python-based network monitoring and analysis dashboard designed for Kali Linux. Built to help users understand network interfaces, monitor connections, inspect network activity, and perform authorized network diagnostics.

### Features
- Interactive web dashboard
- Network interface information
- IP address and routing information
- Network connection monitoring
- Nmap integration
- Wi-Fi interface information
- Network diagnostics
- Security reports
- Kali Linux support

### Technology Stack
- Python
- Flask
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Nmap
- Linux networking tools

### Installation (Kali Linux)

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install -y python3 python3-venv python3-pip iproute2 nmap iw unzip git
```

### Setup

```bash
unzip kriti_network_analyzer.zip
cd kriti_network_analyzer

python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate

python -m pip install --upgrade pip
pip install -r requirements.txt

python app.py
```

### Dashboard

Open your browser:

http://127.0.0.1:5000

